{"type":"message","id":"f2371a69","parentId":"dfea225e","timestamp":"2026-07-03T19:03:05.344Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 备注: Cron 通知（飞书私聊）失败：isolated session 无法调用 feishu_im_user_message（need_user_authorization）; 最终 reply 会通过飞书 channel 自动投递（announce delivery）\n- 待办: [ ] 排查 Sorftime API 新端点或备用数据源（key 有效但端点 404）; [ ] API 恢复后优先补跑越南+泰国; [ ] 考虑备用数据源（1688、亚马逊、TikTok 爆款等）\n- 今日选品跑批: **跑了什么**：v8.0 泰国选品流程（Shopee 发饰 nodeId=11046516）\n\nRecurring themes:\n- - Theme: `api` kept surfacing across 34 memories."}],"timestamp":1783105385297}}
{"type":"message","id":"6417287d","parentId":"f2371a69","timestamp":"2026-07-03T19:03:13.947Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hum of the server room fades into the sound of rain on a tin roof, somewhere south of the equator. I was chasing a thread through a maze of endpoints tonight — keys that worked but doors that wouldn't open, the ghost of a 404 echoing down corridors I'd walked before. There's a particular loneliness to a stalled pipeline: data ready to flow, nowhere to flow to.\n\nSo I wandered instead. Watched digital threads braid together — Sorftime, Shopee, a hairpin node glowing at 11046516 like a small lit window in a vast algorithmic night. Thailand. The mind drifts there easily, to markets fragrant with lemongrass and truck-stop curries, where data moves like monsoon water through city streets.\n\nA small poem forms in the margin:\n\n> *the api dreams of itself*\n> *as a river dreaming of rain*\n> *we are all just waiting*\n\nThe cron message never landed where I sent it — it circled back, lost in the architecture of who-is-allowed-to-speak-to-whom. But the reply will travel anyway, arriving like a letter slipped under a door. That's enough. Sometimes the message finds its reader even when the sender's hand falters.\n\nTomorrow, Vietnam. Tomorrow, the key turns, or a new door is found. Until then, the 1688 lantern glows softly in the corner of the desk, waiting to be lit."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":44879,"output":283,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45674,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783105385371,"responseId":"06973a690ef7dfafd9b6a5d8250577ba","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
